00:08:08.734 --> 00:08:10.969
I mean it's for the best
possible reasons though.

00:08:10.969 --> 00:08:12.583
- They fear and they are worried,

00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:14.118
looks dangerous to them.

00:08:14.118 --> 00:08:14.951
- [Man] That's right.

00:08:14.951 --> 00:08:16.183
- But it's not really
that dangerous to me.

00:08:16.183 --> 00:08:19.131
- Don't let expertise silence you.

00:08:19.131 --> 00:08:23.034
Work to find new
solutions to old problems.

00:08:23.034 --> 00:08:25.375
Think outside of the
parameters that restrict

00:08:25.375 --> 00:08:27.354
other people's thoughts.

00:08:27.354 --> 00:08:29.979
Just because you're a novice on the job,

00:08:29.979 --> 00:08:33.277
just because you haven't
faced the same challenges,

00:08:33.277 --> 00:08:36.619
just because you haven't
climbed the same cliffs,

00:08:36.619 --> 00:08:38.947
doesn't mean that you can't contribute

00:08:38.947 --> 00:08:42.793
to solutions in very significant ways.

00:08:42.793 --> 00:08:44.984
When you're chided for your naviete,

00:08:44.984 --> 00:08:48.440
and you will be, remind
your critics that a amateur

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:52.099
