00:09:45.238 --> 00:09:47.034
you know what I'm saying,
it's no way around it.

00:09:47.034 --> 00:09:49.930
They gon tell you it's no way around.

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:51.291
So if you in the hood right now,

00:09:51.291 --> 00:09:53.494
you standing on the block everyday,

00:09:53.494 --> 00:09:55.274
them police just riding by, that old lady

00:09:55.274 --> 00:09:57.200
that's looking at you, that's
calling the police on you,

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.763
(man laughs)

00:09:58.763 --> 00:10:00.244
the people who riding
by just looking at you

00:10:00.244 --> 00:10:02.246
like they ain't nothing,
your pants sagging,

00:10:02.246 --> 00:10:03.775
