00:10:06.626 --> 00:10:07.736
Who is the person to tell you?

00:10:07.736 --> 00:10:09.001
- [Man] You got to prove 'em wrong.

00:10:09.001 --> 00:10:11.855
- That you gon be standing
on this block all your life.

00:10:11.855 --> 00:10:13.123
It supposed to be a point in your life

00:10:13.123 --> 00:10:14.970
where you only be here,

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:16.304
you give yourself a year or two.

00:10:16.304 --> 00:10:18.702
You from here, it don't do no good

00:10:18.702 --> 00:10:20.619
for you to be here all your life

00:10:20.619 --> 00:10:23.921
and you spending the
majority of your life,

00:10:23.921 --> 00:10:26.521
22 hours out your day trying to prove

